{
  "state_version": 1,
  "_readme": [
    "LEGACY operator-values file for the {{...}} slots in kit-owned files.",
    "The current installer, `governancekit install-agents`, stores these answers in",
    ".gk/operator.json (untracked) and does not read this file; `governancekit",
    "configure` reads it as a legacy source for the operator name. Prefer letting",
    "the installer collect the values.",
    "This file is per-programmer and NEVER tracked: .credentials/.gitignore keeps it",
    "out of git, so each person on the project establishes their own identity.",
    "'values' holds literals. 'refs' holds PATHS to credential files — never the secret.",
    "Mailbox is the LIVE use of this file: `governancekit mail` reads",
    "values.MAILBOX_ADDRESS/OPERATOR_EMAIL and refs.SMTP_TOKEN from here, and",
    "`mail setup --write` records the address here. Do not delete on a mailing project."
  ],
  "values": {
    "OPERATOR_NAME": ""
  },
  "refs": {}
}
